    "订阅名称、金额和日期都保存在你的设备上。续费提醒使用系统本地通知，不会上传到服务器。购买通过 Apple 完成。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Namen, Beträge und Daten bleiben auf dem Gerät. Erinnerungen sind lokal und werden nicht hochgeladen. Käufe laufen über Apple."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Names, amounts, and dates stay on your device. Renewal reminders use local notifications and are not uploaded. Purchases are processed by Apple."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nombres, importes y fechas se quedan en el dispositivo. Los avisos son locales y no se suben. Las compras van por Apple."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noms, montants et dates restent sur l’appareil. Les rappels sont locaux et ne sont pas envoyés. Les achats passent par Apple."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nomi, importi e date restano sul dispositivo. I promemoria sono locali e non vengono caricati. Gli acquisti passano da Apple."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "名前・金額・日付はこのデバイスに保存されます。更新通知はローカル通知で、サーバーには上がりません。購入はApple経由です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이름, 금액, 날짜는 기기에 저장됩니다. 갱신 알림은 로컬 알림이며 서버로 올라가지 않습니다. 구입은 Apple을 통해 이루어집니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nomes, valores e datas ficam no dispositivo. Os lembretes são locais e não são enviados. As compras são pela Apple."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
